	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nOVP:  4.280 V   delay 1.25 s\nUVP:  2.300 V   delay 144 ms\nOCD: +0.125 V   delay 8 ms\nOCC: -0.100 V   delay 8 ms\nSCD: +0.500 V   delay 250 us\n\nEst. trip currents:\nOCD: 0.125 / 0.0148 = ~8.4 A discharge\nOCC: 0.100 / 0.0148 = ~6.8 A charge"
